          "prompt": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><p>Consider the following function:</p><pre><code class=\"language-java\"><span class=\"hljs-type\">int</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">fun</span><span class=\"hljs-params\">(<span class=\"hljs-type\">int</span> n)</span> {\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span> (n == <span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span> || n == <span class=\"hljs-number\">2</span>)\n        <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span>;\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">else</span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> fun(n - <span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span>) + <span class=\"hljs-number\">3</span> * fun(n - <span class=\"hljs-number\">2</span>);\n}</code></pre></div><div class=\"ml-vi\"><p>Xét hàm sau đây:</p><pre><code class=\"language-java\"><span class=\"hljs-type\">int</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">fun</span><span class=\"hljs-params\">(<span class=\"hljs-type\">int</span> n)</span> {\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span> (n == <span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span> || n == <span class=\"hljs-number\">2</span>)\n        <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span>;\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">else</span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> fun(n - <span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span>) + <span class=\"hljs-number\">3</span> * fun(n - <span class=\"hljs-number\">2</span>);\n}</code></pre></div>",
