              "text": "<pre><code class=\"language-java\">Node <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">search</span><span class=\"hljs-params\">(Node p, <span class=\"hljs-type\">int</span> x)</span>\n{ <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span>(p==<span class=\"hljs-literal\">null</span>) <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span>(<span class=\"hljs-literal\">null</span>);\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span>(p.info==x) <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span>(p);\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span>(x&lt;p.info)\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span>(search(p.right,x));\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">else</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span>(search(p.left,x));\n}</code></pre>|||<pre><code class=\"language-java\">Node <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">search</span><span class=\"hljs-params\">(Node p, <span class=\"hljs-type\">int</span> x)</span>\n{ <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span>(p==<span class=\"hljs-literal\">null</span>) <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span>(<span class=\"hljs-literal\">null</span>);\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span>(p.info==x) <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span>(p);\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span>(x&lt;p.info)\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span>(search(p.right,x));\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">else</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span>(search(p.left,x));\n}</code></pre>"
